
### Crear una consulta
POST http://localhost:8080/api/v1/query
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "term": "kafka streams",
    "category": "technology"
}

###

### Otra consulta
POST http://localhost:8080/api/v1/query
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "term": "spring boot",
    "category": "technology"
}

###

### Consulta diferente
POST http://localhost:8080/api/v1/query
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "term": "a",
    "category": "devops"
}

### Esta no entrara por el filtro definido
POST http://localhost:8080/api/v1/query
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "term": "",
    "category": "devops"
}


### Obtener métricas agrupadas por categoría
GET http://localhost:8080/api/v1/metrics/categories
Accept: application/json